The Next 100 Billion Years — flat-vector explainer (1080×1920, 24 fps)
Everything on screen is drawn in code (main.js, canvas 2D): Earth, the Sun, the stars, Mars, Saturn, the galaxies, the odometer, the type.
No images, no stock footage, no generated media. Our own character designs, in the Beyond Everything brand style.
Facts: FACTS.md (Wikipedia: Pole star, Sun; ESA/Gaia; Nature Geoscience; NASA/Icarus; Nature Astronomy 2025; Harvard CfA).

